WIRE.md §5.9, §8.5, DECISIONS 308: a `@text` result record with a dependent field is judged through every branch of its type function: one branch is a Range, so E8151 at stage E, never a failure when the file is written.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A kind.
enum K { a, b }

/// The field's type.
type F(k: K) = match k {
  a => Int
  _ => Range
}

/// A row.
record R {
  /// Its kind.
  k: K
  /// Its value.
  v: F(k)
}

/// The file.
@text("r.json")
export fn r() -> R { return { k: a, v: 1 } }

emit text { out: "out/" }
-- a.r.calls.json --
{ "": { "k": "a", "v": 1 } }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8151]  a/a.canon:22:11
  value r of type a.R has no wire form

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
